	(text "1. USB7206C  USB 3.2 Gen2 hub, VQFN-100 12x12 (EP = VSS, via array to GND planes)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "be3c4afa-1061-4d4e-ba52-bc3f5096a0df")
	)
	(text "2. HUB TX AC-COUPLING  220 nF 0402 X7R in series with every hub SS TX (upstream + 5 downstream)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b293b538-088a-4388-9061-afe726ee1a13")
	)
	(text "Hub RX pairs have no caps here: the transmitting chip's side (TUSB1064/TUSB1046/GL3224/RTL8156/USB-A sheet) provides them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "42e3f213-3fa5-41fc-a492-9a0721914122")
	)
	(text "Place caps within ~5 mm of the hub pins, symmetric per pair, cut the reference plane under the 0402 pads (L2 void) for 10G."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f571c4f2-08e1-46fe-bbcc-9aed97614841")
	)
	(text "3. DECOUPLING  VDD33 x8 pins, VCORE x9 pins: 100 nF per pin at the pin, plus 4.7 uF + 1 nF per rail (DS fig. 4-1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 254.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7d69ea6c-c32c-406c-a1be-047230dcc8da")
	)
	(text "VCORE ~1.31 A (10G upstream + 5x 10G ports: 410 + 5*179 mA), VDD33 ~0.09 A -> ~1.8 W total; theta-JA 19 C/W (2S2P) -> ~+35 K."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 304.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "83bf8d47-2de0-4d9a-b4d4-f02f9405ea2d")
	)
	(text "+1V15 bulk 4x22 uF sits at the TPS62933P (power_rails); route +1V15 as a pour on L4 under the hub."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 307.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ca198d21-2643-44e5-90e7-f66b311d284b")
	)
	(text "4. CLOCK / BIAS / TEST / STRAPS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "727f159b-945c-4e3c-a55c-7c1f0bbe03a3")
	)
	(text "Straps are latched at POR / RESET_N rising edge (hold >= 1 ms after). Config 3 (STRAP2 200k PD, STRAP1 10k PD) is the"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d1420dc2-716b-4ad2-be25-fbb37a28e3d4")
	)
	(text "only valid USB7206C mode: PF26/27 = SMBus slave, PF15/16 = PRT_CTL3/2, PF30 = VBUS_DET, PF18/31 = I2C master (unused)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dae979f4-711c-48d8-9afe-6fb1ae4abb20")
	)
	(text "PF3-7 (I2S), PF18/31 (I2C master), PF19 (MIC_DET), PF29 (GPIO93): unused -> 100k PD.  PF8/9 NC.  PRT_CTL1/4/5/6 float."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aeefe5c8-13b9-4085-9350-eb3e691a539a")
	)
	(text "CFG_NON_REM 200k PU = port 1 non-removable; CFG_BC_EN 10k PU = BC1.2 on ports 1-3. RP2350 refines both over SMBus"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "65f961fc-80ac-439c-8be9-94062e799598")
	)
	(text "(non-removable 1/4/6, BC on 2/3 only) when it is alive; with the RP2350 dead the strap defaults are safe."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2b797fe3-4e65-4e6c-8690-07b4c69a289c")
	)
	(text "5. RESET / VBUS_DET / SMBUS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f11b795-3bbe-442d-8eae-bf74be2fbc50")
	)
	(text "RESET_N = HUB_RESET_N (RP2350 open-drain) AND RAILS_PG (TPS62933P PG, open drain, 100k on power_rails) via D601."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6af9b90c-c729-4818-8bd6-7da8787fb21c")
	)
	(text "  Hub held in standby until +1V15 is in regulation (implies +3V3 up); 10k pull-up then releases it. trst >= 5 us."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "74ee8dff-8571-4e78-aea5-71e804cc0010")
	)
	(text "VBUS_DET (PF30): laptop VBUS / 2 (47k/47k), BAT54WS clamp to +3V3: 4.4 V -> 2.2 V (VIH 2.1), 5.25 V -> 2.63 V (<2.7 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cca7fbf0-2e70-4526-b928-4e57503b8e0e")
	)
	(text "  per checklist), 28 V -> ~3.6 V clamp. VBUS present = laptop attached (deck sources VBUS only after attach)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e0e81a1c-26d1-4270-b57c-a7c38f9da560")
	)
	(text "  VBUS_DET = 0 (no laptop): BC1.2 ports run as DCP; VBUS_DET = 1: CDP once the host powers the port."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ad013903-15c8-4ca9-a8da-a75d10675e93")
	)
	(text "SMBus slave addr 0x2D. Pull-ups only when HUB_SMB_PU (RP2350 GPIO) is high -> hub enters CFG_SMBUS and waits for"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e431e45d-94e6-47c7-99ff-4e6c61c29c6f")
	)
	(text "  the RP2350's config + USB_ATTACH_WITH_SMBUS (AA56h). HUB_SMB_PU low/floating (RP2350 off, BOOTSEL, broken FW):"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fdc165db-b3b1-48ff-9304-564464603a58")
	)
	(text "  no pull-ups seen -> hub boots from ROM+straps+OTP immediately -> RP2350 BOOTSEL (UF2) still enumerates on port 6."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5df12c91-a382-4558-85be-06d1aa5dd9b3")
	)
	(text "  Firmware: SMB_PU high -> RESET_N low >= 5 us -> release -> wait >= 40 ms -> config -> AA56h. No other pull-ups on this bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2057d8ce-2031-4875-bba0-002cada04318")
	)
	(text "6. USB-A PORT POWER  PRT_CTLx = combined power-enable output + overcurrent input (DS 8.2)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "666d2deb-270d-4364-87a0-28bde59a9980")
	)
	(text "USB-A #1 = hub port 2 (PRT_CTL2, PF16), USB-A #2 = hub port 3 (PRT_CTL3, PF15). Port on: pin = input + internal ~50k"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 266.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9d25d088-f4c3-4477-8aed-81781b94d0cd")
	)
	(text "  pull-up (EN high), switch FAULT# (open drain) pulls it low = overcurrent; port off: hub drives it low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 269.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ca0701d5-5478-41ed-b58b-c652ea5df044")
	)
	(text "  USBAx_PWR_EN and USBAx_OCS_N are therefore the SAME node (0R ties, R630/R631). Do NOT add an external pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 271.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5f840290-e2ee-43f4-a06a-4bffebbe0be8")
	)
	(text "  usb_a sheet: TPS2553 EN = PWR_EN OR FORCE_EN (gate input, high-Z), FAULT# open-drain -> OCS_N."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 274.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "42e75ff0-52be-47cd-957a-380e824c16a0")
	)
	(text "Embedded ports (1 GL3224, 4 RTL8156, 5 TUSB1046/PMG1, 6 RP2350): PRT_CTL floats (internal pull-up, never reads OC)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 276.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "68ad625e-fd0c-4c2d-8a92-05f8d0641660")
	)
	(text "7. OPTIONAL SPI FLASH (DNP)  only for Microchip-supplied custom firmware; ROM + straps + SMBus/OTP is the plan"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 297.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d674e8b3-bbe3-421e-8f15-356d510b3d9b")
	)
	(text "Hub boots from flash only if it holds a valid image with the '2DFU' signature at 0x3FFFA; a blank flash -> ROM boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 325.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "97d3b220-7278-4461-aaea-bd05dfb41309")
	)
	(text "With the flash fitted the CE#/D0 strap resistors stay (they are read before the flash is probed). Fit R614 (D3 10k PU)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 327.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16131908-fbbf-4265-b73f-1b4a97909d94")
	)
	(text "and remove R613 (D3 PD) so HOLD# is inactive. Flash images come only from Microchip -> not planned for odeck-10."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 330.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4aee68b1-1f5a-4116-9fcc-bef9162dfae5")
	)
